{
  "name": "fairdrive-used-vehicle-aging",
  "version": "0.1.0",
  "description": "Fairdrive Used Vehicle Aging: ages the used-vehicle inventory, flags units past your wholesale age, priced above or well below market, priced below cost or with a stale price, and totals cost by age. Never changes a price or lists a car at auction.",
